         
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                                        
                                                             ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮                                                             
                                                             │                                                                            │                                                             
                                                             │  Welcome to Agent Deck                                                     │                                                             
                                                             │                                                                            │                                                             
                                                             │  Run many AI coding agents at once, each in its own session. Switch        │                                                             
                                                             │  between them with one key. Works on any machine, this one or a remote.    │                                                             
                                                             │                                                                            │                                                             
                                                             │  Your agents                                                               │                                                             
                                                             │  > ✓ Claude Code  installed · signed in                                    │                                                             
                                                             │    ✓ Codex        installed · not signed in                                │                                                             
                                                             │    x Gemini CLI   install: npm install -g @google/gemini-cli               │                                                             
                                                             │    x Pi           install: npm install -g @mariozechner/pi-coding-agent    │                                                             
                                                             │      Plain shell  just a terminal, no agent                                │                                                             
                                                             │                                                                            │                                                             
                                                             │  Enter: new session with Claude Code in /work/billing-api, Enter again     │                                                             
                                                             │  starts it.                                                                │                                                             
                                                             │                                                                            │                                                             
                                                             │  Found a bug or have an idea? Press Z on the main screen to report it.     │                                                             
                                                             │                                                                            │                                                             
                                                             │  ↑↓ pick · Enter start · l log in                                          │                                                             
                                                             │  r re-check · Tab what you can do · Esc skip                               │                                                             
